WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
João is Clécio,

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.500
and he told Isabel that Clécio will create

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.500
the Women's Health Specialty Center.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Now Isabel is Clécio.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Isabel told Gabriel

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.500
that Clécio will create microcredit

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.500
with low interest and no red tape.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Now Gabriel is Clécio.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Gabriel told Wendel

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.500
that Clécio will expand the Amapá Jovem program,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.500
creating more jobs and income for young people.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Now Wendel is Clécio.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Your vote can count twice.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Share Clécio's ideas.
